questions.questionTextEn:
Consider the code:
```c
int a = 5;
int b = a + 3;
int c = b * 2;
return c;
```
Which of the following optimizations collaborate to simplify this entire block to `return 16;`?

What integer is printed by the following statically scoped program?
```text
int a = 3;
int f(int b) { return a + b; }
int g() { int a = 10; return f(a); }
main() { print(g()); }
```
